* Technical concepts\nbehind the 2024 hacks
** Signing and keys
*** Safe execTransaction, EIP-712 hash, DELEGATECALL
*** Blind signing, spoofed UI (WazirX, Radiant)
*** Supplier compromise (DMM)
*** Minter roles, M-of-N thresholds (PlayDapp, Gala, Orbit)
** Upgrades and initialisation
*** Uninitialised vote weight (Ronin)
*** Storage pre-seeded before upgrade (Munchables)
** Approvals and calls
*** Arbitrary call spends approvals (LI.FI, Seneca)
*** Approval to a caller-chosen address (Hedgey)
*** Callback trust: reentrancy (Penpie), flash-loan initiator (Prisma)
** Accounting and math
*** Empty-market donation, rounding (Sonne)
*** elastic/base rounding (Abracadabra)
*** Unchecked underflow (Velocore), missing bound (Thala)
** Prices
*** Reserve-based spot price (Polter)
*** Median of manipulable sources (UwU Lend)
** Users
*** Address poisoning
*** Ownership and permit phishing
@endmindmap
